OL,5,G2100 Flipping Bangers
OL,6,     FBMW Z3: Will and Gus want to buy a
OL,7,     FBMW, and Will says he likes the
OL,8,     F'feminine' Z3. There's a trade-in
OL,9,     Fup the road which might fit the
OL,10,     Fbill, but it's a high price.
OL,11,G2200 Flipping Bangers
OL,12,     FMercedes: Will and Gus splash out
OL,13,     F550 pounds on a garage owner's
OL,14,     FMercedes 190. The previous owner
OL,15,     Fhas failed to fix it, but the duo
OL,16,     Fare more confident.
OL,17,G2300 Flipping Bangers
OL,18,     FMazda: Will and Gus take on a
OL,19,     FMazda MX-5 that's been given some
OL,20,     Freal boy racer attitude, hoping to
OL,21,     Freturn it to its former glory.
